a Knight of the Rose~
The Solamnic Knight of the Order of the Rose stands here.
~
   Of all of the lands in all of the realms there is not a finer warrior than a
Knight of the Rose.  The highest and most respected of the three orders, the
Order of the Rose contains only the finest and purest knights of Krynn, as you
can see when you look upon this powerful warrior. So great are the deeds of the
Knights of the Rose that Paladine himself has bestowed magical power and 
protection onto them. As you gaze upon this powerful knight, you know that he
has to power to vanquish all evil.  You're not evil are you?
~
