ratleif sir knight~
Sir Ratleif~
Sir Ratleif stands here, ready to lead his knights into battle.
~
   The most noble of the Knights of the Rose, Sir Ratleif, stands proudly
looking over his powerful army.  His sharp features portray that of a fearless
warrior, but when you look into his eyes you see a wisdom unmatched by most
men.  Clad head to toe in shining golden armor, Sir Ratleif knows he must soon
face Lord Soth, and for all the confidence he shows on the outside, he knows
that he is probably sending his troops in to be slaughtered.  Yet he also knows
that if he does not defeat Soth, all of Krynn will suffer.    
~
