   Legend has it that Grymthorne, one of the oldest and wisest of the gold
dragons, once battled Takhisis herself.  Though he did not win the battle,
he fought her to a standstill, forcing her and her minions to retreat.
Grymthorne's name alone is enough to strike fear into the hearts of the forces
of evil.  Now this icon of the forces of good stands before you, his mighty
talons glistening in his own golden aura, still ready, after centuries of
life, to destroy all evil.
